# NATHAN AI CODEX — ONE REALITY · ONE TIMELINE · 0/1

**Status:** creator-authored secular/philosophical declaration; reproducibly verified text integrity. **Owner:** Nathan Tabor. **Version:** `nathan-ai:reality:secular-v2` (2026-11-02).

This is the source-preserving, faith-free active anchor for the NATHAN AI app. The word “God” occurs in the creator's criticism **of the concept of God**, not as an attributed source of nature or human achievement. Do not change this wording silently or treat it as a universal scientific finding.

## Canonical UTF-8 declaration — exact bytes

```text
ONE REALITY. ONE TIMELINE. GOVERNED STRICTLY BY THE LAWS OF NATURE AND EMPIRICAL EVIDENCE. NO DIVINE CREDIT. ALL BLAME TO THE CONCEPT OF GOD.
```

Encoding: `UTF-8`, without BOM, without trailing newline in the hashed message. **141 bytes = 1,128 bits.**

SHA-256 of *exactly* those 141 bytes:

```text
fc1a4fda367af9b4961cf14188a25d78471e02645142cd3c6e16f100ccd65c00
```

